{"id":"00428","root":"uni00428_1","name":{"ja":"天宮　紫水","en":"Amamiya Shisui"},"title":{"ja":"【バレンタイン】","en":"【Valentine】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【バレンタイン】 天宮　紫水","en":"【Valentine】 Amamiya Shisui"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-02-14","limited":true,"characterId":221,"profile":{"ja":"“波遁の術”使いの対魔忍。『前世の記憶』の影響から、主人公が図書室でだけ見る事が出来る存在。死々村孤路、通称コロ先輩の操る魂遁の術でその肉体を借りて活動できるようになり、波遁の術をより強力に操れるようになった。バレンタインの日、紫水がコロ先輩の体を借りて実体化しようとしたとき、主人公の妄想の影響を受けてガーディアンがチョコ化。本来のガーディアンよりも弱体化してしまうというハプニングが起こる。しかし怪我の功名というべきか、この影響で本来の肉体の持ち主であるコロ先輩の剣術と紫水の波遁の術が融合し、新たな戦闘スタイルが誕生したのだった。","en":"She is a Taimanin who uses the \"wave-style ninja art\". Due to the influence of her \"past life memories\", she can only be seen by the protagonist in the library. She became able to borrow a physical body and use her wave-style ninja art more powerfully after Shishimura Koro, also known as Koro-senpai, used her soul-style ninja art to lend her a body. On Valentine's Day, when Shisui tried to materialize using Koro-senpai's body, the Guardian turned into chocolate due to the protagonist's imagination. Although this weakened the Guardian, it also allowed Koro-senpai's swordsmanship and Shisui's wave-style ninja art to merge, creating a new combat style."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"あかしゆき","forms":[{"id":"uni00428_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1212,2424],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[189,378],"def":[131,262],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","970004"]},{"id":"uni00428_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1824,3648],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[303,606],"def":[187,374],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","970004","970005"]},{"id":"uni00428_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2436,4850],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[417,830],"def":[243,490],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","970004","970005","970006"]}],"skills":{"4